Qillqa patapi: ['html'] ruway: { <- (
		kikin
		rantinpay: ['&'] kayta: ['&amp;'],
		rantinpay: ['<'] kayta: ['&lt;'],
		rantinpay: ['>'] kayta: ['&gt;'],
		rantinpay: ['"'] kayta: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Katiray musuq.

['Verbatim Syntax'] simikuna sapallanpaq: { :yupayman :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (yupayman), Letter: letter).
}.

Lluqsiy list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list huñuy: ['↵']).

Lluqsiy qillqay: template.

